                            <span>Tốc độ phản hồi URL:</span>
                            <span class="text-slate-800 dark:text-white font-mono font-bold">&lt; 15ms (L1 Cache)</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <button type="button" class="w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-700 hover:to-teal-700 shadow-md shadow-emerald-500/25 transition">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk me-1.5"></i> Cập Nhật SEO & Lưu Cache
